details.returned_prompt:
{
  "high_level_description": "A documentary photograph of three clinicians pausing mid-conversation in a bright hospital corridor on a weekday morning, anchored slightly right of center in a loose triangle, shot on iPhone with cool-neutral white balance and fine Kodak Portra grain.",
  "compositional_deconstruction": {
    "background": "A bright hospital corridor interior with pale blue-grey walls and a continuous stainless-steel handrail running along the right side at hip height. Polished vinyl floor reflects the window light in soft elongated streaks. A tall window deep in the background lets in cool morning daylight through a half-drawn sheer curtain, the light raking locally across the floor and catching coat edges without washing the whole frame. Soft natural falloff into corridor depth, mild background motion from a distant figure walking away near the far end of the hall. Cool-neutral white balance, true-to-life skin tones, accurate clinical whites without amber cast.",
    "elements": [
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Doorway visible behind the group in the midground, set into the pale blue-grey wall. White-painted door frame around a closed door. Small wall-mounted hand sanitizer dispenser beside it at shoulder height, white plastic housing with a clear reservoir."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Middle-aged woman clinician standing center-right of the group, in three-quarter view facing left toward her colleagues, body angled inward. Medium build, light skin tone, shoulder-length brown hair pulled back loosely. White lab coat over a soft grey blouse and dark trousers, low brown leather loafers. Stethoscope draped around her neck. Both hands hold a slim tablet at chest height angled toward her colleagues, head tilted down toward the screen with a focused considering expression, gaze directed at the tablet."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Younger male clinician standing to the left of the woman, in three-quarter view facing right toward her, leaning slightly forward listening. Light skin tone, short dark brown hair, clean-shaven. White lab coat over a pale blue button-down shirt and charcoal chinos, brown derby shoes. Left hand holds an open spiral notebook at waist height, right hand pinches a pen mid-gesture near chest level. Gaze directed at the woman's tablet."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Third clinician standing to the left of the male clinician, in three-quarters turned view facing right toward the other two as he speaks. Medium build, warm medium-brown skin tone, short black hair, trimmed beard. Olive crewneck sweater over a white tee collar visible at the neckline, dark jeans, white sneakers. Right hand tucked into his front pocket, left hand gesturing lightly at chest height. Gaze directed at the woman."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Out-of-focus rolling IV stand cropped into the lower-left foreground edge, only the upper pole and hook arm visible. Slim chrome pole with a clear fluid bag hanging from the hook, blurred from foreground proximity."
      }
    ]
  }
}
